sequenceDiagram
  participant Dev as Developer (Editor)
  participant Code as CodeLens / Command
  participant Cmd as runFeature (src/run/runFeature.ts)
  participant Term as TerminalManager (src/utils/terminalManager.ts)
  participant Runner as Cypress Generic Runner (external)
  participant FS as Report JSON (cypress/reports)
  participant Decor as FeatureReportDecorator (src/editor/FeatureReportDecorator.ts)
  participant Lens as FeatureReportCodeLensProvider (src/editor/FeatureReportCodeLensProvider.ts)
  participant Diag as FeatureDiagnostics (src/editor/FeatureDiagnostics.ts)

  Dev->>Code: Click "Run Feature" (CodeLens)
  Code->>Cmd: execute featureAssured.runFeature
  Cmd->>Term: spawn cypress (npx / docker) with feature spec
  Term->>Runner: run feature (uses @yassinouhadi/cypress-generic-package)
  Runner-->>FS: emit cucumber-report.json + screenshots
  FS-->>Decor: file change event (chokidar)
  Decor->>Lens: refresh features & regenerate CodeLenses
  Decor->>Diag: update diagnostics (pass/fail, stack traces)
  Lens->>Dev: show inline results & CodeLens actions
  Diag->>Dev: populate Problems panel